ing  the final showdown between the winter  soldier and captain america  steve is able to jog his memory once  again now after cap falls from a shield  helicarrier bucky saves his life by  pulling him from a river and then sets  off to try and rediscover who he truly  is now falcon becomes an avenger after  fighting alongside the team in avengers  age of ultron which  sees tony stark creating an artificial  intelligence named ultron that turns  into a villain and tries to destroy the  world but in doing so he basically wipes  out the country of sokovia now this  makes the international community  really pissed off towards the avengers  and in captain america civil war the u.n  meets to sign the sokovia accords which  will basically set up an international  panel that's designed to oversee the  superheroes now the accords are supposed  to be signed in vienna but a bomb goes  off and security tapes implicate bucky  as the bomber making him a wanted man  not only by the authorities but by  t'challa the black panther whose father  t'chaka was killed in the explosion and  who wants to kill bucky barnes now this  guy's just pissing everybody off but  captain america and falcon track down  bucky and romania and steve warns him  that he's in danger as if bucky didn't  know now bucky tells cap that the real  u.n bomber was helmut zemo who lost his  family in sokovia and wanted to take out  the avengers and by framing bucky for  the bombing he almost got his wish  captain america falcon wanda maximoff  and ant-man try to bring zemo in on  their own  while iron man black widow black panther  war machine vision and peter parker are  sent by the u.s secretary  of state thunderbolt ross to capture  them all for violating the sokovia  accords  this results in a fight between the  avengers but ultimately cap and bucky  escape  but after learning that bucky was not to  blame iron man tracks down steve and  bucky but after zemo reveals that the  winter soldier killed iron man's dad  