 stream  wouldn't be all screwed up and for the  most part he did but instead of doing  that and then just returning to the  present day like he was supposed to he  stays in the past and lives out his  entire life that he never got to  experience with his girlfriend peggy  carter he then shows up at the end of  the film as an old man rambling about  how great things were when he was  younger and how kids have green hair  these days and it's beyond  everything and meets with bucky and  falcon now when falcon laments the fact  that he now has to live in a world with  no captain america in it captain america  hands falcon the shield now this is a  somewhat tense moment because bucky's  basically just standing there watching  his best friend  pass along his legacy to the guy that  replaced him as his best friend but he  gives sam a little nod to let him know  that he was cool with it even though it  stung a little bit so yeah that's  basically all you need to know  going into the disney plus series so now  you can dive in no matter how much of  the mcu you've seen because now you're  all basically caught up with that being  said guys we're gonna bring this to an  end thank you guys for watching we will  catch you all later  peace

